			"notes": "1.21.4 port + support for the new CustomModelData component.\n\n## Changelog\n- Updated to 1.21.4.\n- The CustomModelData field can now contain a string or an integer to be used for `matching` / `range_dispatch` model types.\n\nYou will have to update your resource packs to get your CustomModelData to work in the new format but the \"CustomModelData ids\" in the previous data file is automatically converted to a string when saving in this new version.\nSo don't worry about that!\n\n_I am not going to bother porting this version to <1.21.4 as this version doesn't add anything worth the effort. Just use [v1.2.4](https://github.com/ImCodist/quick-menu/releases/tag/v1.2.4) or [v1.2.3](https://github.com/ImCodist/quick-menu/releases/tag/v1.2.3)._"
		},
